%% Production-shaped SRE incident response workflow.
%% Demonstrates: yaml frontmatter, multi-inbound states, retry loops,
%% _choice-keyed branching, and a cyclical workflow (PostmortemAnalysis
%% loops back to Idle for the next incident).
---
config:
  layout: elk
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> MonitoringAlert: Alert Received
    Idle --> IncidentReview: Manual Trigger

    MonitoringAlert --> IncidentAnalysis: Analyze Metrics
    IncidentReview --> IncidentAnalysis: Review Triggered

    IncidentAnalysis --> DiagnosisInProgress: Gathering Data

    DiagnosisInProgress --> RootCauseIdentified: Root Cause Found
    DiagnosisInProgress --> EscalateToTeam: Unable to Diagnose

    RootCauseIdentified --> RemediationPlanning: Planning Fix

    RemediationPlanning --> ExecutingFix: Deploy Remediation
    RemediationPlanning --> ManualReview: Complex Issue

    ExecutingFix --> VerifyingResolution: Monitor Fix
    ManualReview --> EscalateToTeam: Needs Expert Review

    VerifyingResolution --> Resolved: Issue Fixed
    VerifyingResolution --> RollbackNeeded: Fix Failed

    RollbackNeeded --> ExecutingFix: Retry
    RollbackNeeded --> EscalateToTeam: Rollback Complete

    Resolved --> PostmortemAnalysis: Generate Report
    EscalateToTeam --> PostmortemAnalysis: Team Resolved

    PostmortemAnalysis --> Idle: Complete

    Idle --> [*]
